From: mira <mira@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 23:30:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] [feature](be) Add ob-kill60 signal handler infrastructure

Mirrors OceanBase's MP_SIG dispatch and two-phase per-thread coordination
without the SignalWorker thread (the HTTP coordinator runs the role
inline). New ObSigHandlerCtx with TAS spin-lock, anti-spoof req_id, and
fixed PC frame buffer; libunwind-based safe_backtrace; install hook that
installs ob_signal_handler for MP_SIG only (Doris BE already owns
SIGSEGV/SIGABRT/SIGBUS/SIGFPE/SIGILL/SIGTERM through its own failure
handler).

Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_signal_struct.h:111-127
Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_signal_struct.cpp:90-110
Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_signal_handlers.cpp:73-120
Reference: <ob>/deps/oblib/src/lib/signal/ob_libunwind.c:26-99
---
 be/src/common/ob_signal_handler.cpp | 202 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 be/src/common/ob_signal_handler.h   | 108 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 310 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 be/src/common/ob_signal_handler.cpp
 create mode 100644 be/src/common/ob_signal_handler.h

